00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Trinity and Beyond: The Atomic Bomb Movie is a documentary,
history, war film directed by Peter Kuran.

2
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:36,000
"Trinity and Beyond" is an unsettling yet visually fascinating documentary presenting
the history of nuclear weapons development and testing between 1945-1963.

3
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Narrated by William Shatner and featuring an original score performed by the Moscow Symphony Orchestra, this
award-winning documentary reveals previously unreleased and classified government footage from several countries.

4
